    {
      "source": "Use the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> of <code>Publishers</code> to write the body\nof the HttpOutputMessage to the underlying HTTP layer, flushing after\neach <code>Publisher&lt;DataBuffer&gt;</code>.",
