      "source": "Wraps another <a href=\"ClientHttpRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.client.reactive\"><code>ClientHttpRequest</code></a> and delegates all methods to it.\nSubclasses can override specific methods selectively.",
      "translation": "封装另一个 `<a href=\"ClientHttpRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.client.reactive\"><code>ClientHttpRequest</code></a>` 并将其所有方法委托给它。子类可以有选择地重写特定方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <a href=\"../../../core/io/buffer/DataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferFactory</code></a> that can be used to create the body.",
      "translation": "返回一个可用于创建主体的<a href=\"../../../core/io/buffer/DataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Indicate that message handling is complete, allowing for any cleanup or\nend-of-processing tasks to be performed such as applying header changes\nmade via <a href=\"../../HttpMessage.html#getHeaders()\"><code>HttpMessage.getHeaders()</code></a> to the underlying HTTP message (if not\napplied already).",
      "translation": "指示消息处理已完成，从而允许执行任何清理或处理结束任务，例如将通过<a href=\"../../HttpMessage.html#getHeaders()\"><code>HttpMessage.getHeaders()</code></a>应用的标头更改应用到底层 HTTP 消息（如果尚未应用）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> to write the body of the message to the\nunderlying HTTP layer.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a> 将消息体写入底层 HTTP 层。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
